 "verdict_zh": "资金表按标题收益把 ticket_n5_beta020_8bp 排第一（12.72%/年）；扣掉 N=58 的搜索租金后它掉到第 2 位、只剩 0.55%/年，比躺利息（1.78%/年）少 ¥12,243/年。第一位换成了 n5_vol08_10bp （1.81%/年）。翻转只发生在最上面两名，但位置全变：标题第一的书付完租金后是四只里第 2 位，而四只里有 3 只落在现金腿之下。",
 "chosen_arm": "ticket_n5_beta020_8bp",
 "caveats": [
  "The two own-window frames are printed for context only; the verdict is read off the common window, because a comparison across different windows is not a comparison (r1262).",
  "N is not derivable from the repo: the ladder prints the mechanical counts and the verdict is taken at the smallest of them (58), so the haircut errs high.",
  "The beta-covered ticket adds a cash leg and de-levers; part of its lower Sharpe is the cash return in a window where the repo rate fell. That is priced in as published, not adjusted.",
  "The basket's N is the same ladder on purpose -- the mix was chosen inside the sample window, so on its own window it is not rent-free either.",
  "The 13.3-year basket history is printed, but its verdict frame is the common window; a longer window with a lower Sharpe is not extra evidence for the present.",
  "check() does not re-run the engine: it re-anchors the printed measurement to the published faces and re-derives every number from it. Re-measuring is `run`'s job, and the chain leg must run unconditionally.",
  "Costs are 10bp/side (8bp for the ticket) with no impact term; the capacity face owns size effects. No stamp duty, no dividend withholding, no borrow on the hedge legs."
 ]
